A refined version

Whenever the vanilla version isn’t enough, there are a few options you can explore within the same

frame. One is to improve the search query launched on the vector store by asking the LLM to reword it

for you. Another is to improve the documents’ order (remember: order matters in LLMs) and eventually

summarizing and/or rewording them if needed.

The full process would look like this (see Figure 3-3):

